/* ClearMark interface strings. */
"Markdown. Just press Space." = "Markdown，按空格即可预览。";
"Space bar" = "空格键";
"Install once. Preview whenever." = "安装一次，随时预览。";
"Select a Markdown file in Finder and press Space. You can quit this app — Quick Look keeps working." = "在访达中选中 Markdown 文件，按下空格键即可预览。退出此应用后，快速预览仍可正常使用。";
"If needed, enable ClearMark Preview in System Settings → Extensions → Quick Look." = "如未生效，请在系统设置 → 扩展 → 快速预览中启用 ClearMark Preview。";
"Quick Look Setup" = "设置快速预览";
"View on GitHub" = "在 GitHub 上查看";
"Language" = "语言";
"Follow system" = "跟随系统";
"Appearance" = "外观";
"Light" = "浅色";
"Dark" = "深色";
"Paper" = "纸张";
"Text size" = "文字大小";
"Wide layout" = "宽版布局";
"Document outline" = "文档目录";
"Reading" = "阅读";
"Code highlighting" = "代码高亮";
"Math formulas" = "数学公式";
"Mermaid diagrams" = "Mermaid 图表";
"Rendering" = "渲染";
"Only the features a document needs are loaded. Everything renders offline." = "只加载当前文档需要的功能，所有内容均在本地渲染。";
"Changes apply the next time you open a preview." = "设置将在下次打开预览时生效。";
"No background app. No account. Free forever." = "无需后台运行，无需账号，永久免费。";
"Reset" = "恢复默认";
"Couldn’t save settings" = "无法保存设置";
"OK" = "好";
