"This document is larger than 8 MB. Open a smaller file to keep previews responsive." = "此文档超过 8 MB。请预览较小的文件，以保持流畅。";
"This file isn’t readable text. Save it as UTF-8 or UTF-16 and try again." = "无法读取此文本文件。请保存为 UTF-8 或 UTF-16 编码后重试。";
"Choose a Markdown or plain text document." = "请选择 Markdown 或纯文本文档。";
"This resource is outside the document’s folder or cannot be previewed." = "此资源位于文档文件夹之外，或无法预览。";
"The preview could not render." = "无法渲染预览。";
